1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 3=

3
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,520
Lu Jiawei?

4
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Li Ke.

5
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,600
Why did you kill me?

6
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,440
I didn't kill you.

7
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:25,840
It wasn't me.

8
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:27,000
It wasn't me.

9
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:30,000
Then why did you say those things to me?

10
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,040
I was just jealous.

11
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,080
I hated you for having everything.

12
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:35,880
That night,

13
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,800
I just wanted you to know the truth.

14
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,560
For the past three years,

15
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,800
Xiao Minghua has been having
an affair with me.

16
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,400
He doesn't love you at all.

17
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:45,520
It was those things you said

18
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,040
that drove me to suicide.

19
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:48,600
No.

20
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,040
I thought you'd be devastated.

21
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:52,800
But you weren't.

22
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:55,920
Yet you still took your own life.

23
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:57,880
I'm sorry.

24
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,400
It's my fault you're dead.

25
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,680
You're Ada.

26
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,120
Wasn't your program rewritten?

27
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,840
How did you get here?

28
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:18,960
(Tell her)

29
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:20,280
(you were sent by Cedar to investigate)

30
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,520
(Lu Jiawei's death.)

31
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,920
Cedar already suspects something
about Ms. Lu's death.

32
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,040
When I came to Mr. Xiao,

33
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:27,520
I was tasked with investigating it.

34
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,640
Ms. Li,

35
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,040
I've recorded everything

36
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,320
you just said.

37
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,080
I hope you'll tell me

38
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,040
everything you know

39
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,360
to make amends to Ms. Lu.

40
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,600
Xiao Minghua and I have been

41
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,120
having an affair for three years.

42
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:46,240
He kept saying he'd marry me
after his divorce.

43
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,920
But I was tired of waiting.

44
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:50,120
So I secretly arranged
to meet Lu Jiawei.

45
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:01,920
So when Xiao Minghua said
he was home with Yuchen,

46
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:04,280
he was actually having
an affair with you.

47
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,080
Yes.

48
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,720
He stopped loving you long ago.

49
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:08,800
What about Yuchen?

50
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,560
Whenever you two were together,

51
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,520
where was he?

52
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,520
He was drawing

53
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,160
or

54
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:18,040
spending time with that robot vacuum.

55
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,320
He said the robot was like you

56
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,400
because it could keep him company.

57
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:27,120
Did Xiao Minghua send you to see me?

58
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,240
No.

59
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,240
I came on my own.

60
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:32,200
If you know what's good for you,

61
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,320
divorce him.

62
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:34,800
A marriage without love

63
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,960
will never last.

64
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,280
Actually, I realized long ago

65
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,640
that he didn't love me anymore.

66
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,720
Otherwise, I wouldn't
have developed depression.

67
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,120
Li Ke.

68
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,320
What exactly do you love about him?

69
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,280
He's

70
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:51,920
very gentle

71
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,400
and elegant.

72
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,000
He's also generous with me.

73
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,360
That's all thanks to
the Lu family's money

74
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,120
and connections.

75
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,520
If he were poor,

76
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,040
would you still love him?

77
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:14,520
I don't think you'd be
as foolish as I once was.

78
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:20,960
I don't blame you.

79
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,840
Xiao Minghua is the one who should

80
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,720
take responsibility for this marriage.

81
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,320
But everything you love about him,

82
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,840
he's about to lose.

83
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,480
I'll divorce him

84
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:32,960
and have the shareholders

85
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,440
kick him out of Cedar.

86
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:37,560
When that happens,

87
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,520
I hope you'll still want to marry him.

88
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:46,720
Although she was furious,

89
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,280
she wasn't hopeless.

90
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,000
I don't know if you, as an android,

91
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,160
can understand this.

92
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,760
Her family is wealthy,

93
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,320
and she's beautiful.

94
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,920
Even if she divorced
and had to raise a child,

95
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,680
she could still live a carefree life.

96
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,720
If I were her,

97
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,920
I'd never take my own life.

98
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,680
So...

99
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:06,120
So Xiao Minghua must have killed her.

100
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,520
(Because if Lu Jiawei divorced him,)

101
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:13,120
he'd lose everything he had.

102
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,720
That's also possible.

103
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,520
(Xiao Minghua is truly despicable.)

104
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,400
(But that's still just speculation.)

105
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,960
(We need direct evidence)

106
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,200
(to convict Xiao Minghua.)

107
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,720
Exactly.

108
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,840
Are you talking to me?

109
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,880
No, Ms. Li.

110
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,200
Thank you for your statement.

111
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,520
We'll need your cooperation again later.

112
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:36,960
Whatever the case,

113
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,360
what happened to her

114
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,200
was after our conversation.

115
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,320
I'll do whatever I can to help.

116
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,440
Ms. Li,

117
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,800
actually, I need you

118
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,840
to do me a favor right now.

119
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,600
What brings you here?

120
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,720
You haven't come to see me all day.

121
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,200
I've missed you so much.

122
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,440
The child's upstairs.
Keep your voice down.

123
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,360
It's fine.

124
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,210
(Cedar's security system access key)

125
00:06:29,350 --> 00:06:31,160
is usually kept physically isolated

126
00:06:31,180 --> 00:06:32,220
within the hardware

127
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:33,860
to prevent remote interception.

128
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:34,500
Ada.

129
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:36,260
I need you to find
where he's hidden the key.

130
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:39,140
(Understood.)

131
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:41,780
(Unregistered hardware detected.)

132
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:43,740
(The signal is coming from this study.)

133
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:45,060
Pinpoint its exact location.

134
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:46,540
(Location confirmed.)

135
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:48,900
(The signal is coming
from the bookshelf.)

136
00:06:53,780 --> 00:06:55,940
Xiao Minghua has detected
something unusual in the study.

137
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,460
Hurry, Ada.

138
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:04,020
What are you doing?

139
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:06,700
Shouldn't you be in sleep mode?

140
00:07:07,580 --> 00:07:08,820
He's already suspicious of you.

141
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:10,020
Just say something.

142
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:11,780
(I detected excessive dust)

143
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:13,420
(particle levels in the study.)

144
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:15,620
(Planning a cleaning route.)

145
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:17,300
(You...)

146
00:07:17,300 --> 00:07:19,140
(Your first-generation android system)

147
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:21,060
(even has)

148
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:22,220
- (Minghua.)
- (a cleaning function?)

149
00:07:22,420 --> 00:07:24,220
(Why were you in the bathroom so long?)

150
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:25,380
(You left me alone in bed.)

151
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:26,940
(Oh.)

152
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:28,620
Coming.

153
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:30,820
Then go ahead and clean.

154
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:45,860
Did you get it, Ada?

155
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:51,740
That's it.

156
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:05,700
(Robot vacuum, attempting
to connect to Eda, status: Handshaking)

157
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:06,980
(What are you looking at?)

158
00:08:08,220 --> 00:08:09,060
Song Yang.

159
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:10,420
I think this robot vacuum

160
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:12,140
that Lu Jiawei left behind

161
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:13,940
is trying to tell me something.

162
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:17,140
A robot vacuum

163
00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:18,540
is trying to talk to you?

164
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:20,220
(Song Yang.)

165
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:23,020
(Can you help me scan it?)

166
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:25,620
Give me a moment.

167
00:08:34,940 --> 00:08:36,420
This foreign object must be

168
00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:38,140
causing its unusual behavior.

169
00:08:41,340 --> 00:08:42,260
Hello.

170
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:43,660
My name is Ada.

171
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:46,540
Could you show me

172
00:08:46,740 --> 00:08:47,780
(what you've been hiding?)

173
00:08:48,060 --> 00:08:50,540
You're talking to a robot vacuum?

174
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:52,340
Yes.

175
00:08:52,780 --> 00:08:54,060
You've always kept Ms. Lu

176
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:55,100
and Yuchen company.

177
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:57,180
You're part of this family, too.

178
00:08:57,580 --> 00:08:58,620
(I'm investigating)

179
00:08:58,620 --> 00:08:59,900
(the truth behind Ms. Lu's death.)

180
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:01,700
(I hope you can help me.)

181
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,420
(Don't worry.)

182
00:09:04,700 --> 00:09:06,580
I'll make sure Yuchen gets out of here

183
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:08,380
and finds a better life.

184
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:16,420
That can't be possible.

185
00:09:16,620 --> 00:09:18,100
Older robot vacuums

186
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,500
don't even have AI systems.

187
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:21,380
How could it respond
to what you're saying?

188
00:09:56,940 --> 00:09:58,020
What's this?

189
00:09:58,140 --> 00:09:59,180
I think

190
00:09:59,540 --> 00:10:01,420
this holds the answer
to Lu Jiawei's death.

191
00:10:06,060 --> 00:10:06,983
(Cedar headquarters)
With what happened to Liu Ying recently,

192
00:10:06,983 --> 00:10:08,060
(Lu Jiawei's memorial service)
With what happened to Liu Ying recently,

193
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:10,060
we're all getting older, too.

194
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:12,220
Cedar still needs

195
00:10:12,460 --> 00:10:13,580
young people like you

196
00:10:13,580 --> 00:10:14,860
to keep it going.

197
00:10:15,060 --> 00:10:15,580
Go on.

198
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:16,660
Good boy.

199
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:22,660
I've gathered everyone here today

200
00:10:22,740 --> 00:10:24,460
to remember my wife,

201
00:10:24,660 --> 00:10:25,340
Lu Jiawei.

202
00:10:25,540 --> 00:10:27,180
When Jiawei left us,

203
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:28,780
she took half my soul with her.

204
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:31,540
Countless times,
I've wanted to follow her.

205
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:33,020
But I know I can't.

206
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:34,780
Yet missing her

207
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:37,020
will always be painful.

208
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:39,740
So I pleaded with the company

209
00:10:40,060 --> 00:10:42,300
to find me

210
00:10:42,460 --> 00:10:44,260
an android identical to Jiawei,

211
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:45,620
so that Jiawei

212
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:47,740
could return to my side

213
00:10:47,740 --> 00:10:49,100
in another form.

214
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:51,820
Now, please welcome

215
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:52,580
Ada.

216
00:10:59,860 --> 00:11:00,620
Jiawei.

217
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:02,180
I've missed you so much.

218
00:11:03,300 --> 00:11:04,140
Mr. Xiao.

219
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:06,260
I've detected several
logical inconsistencies

220
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:08,020
between your statements and the facts.

221
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:10,620
Ada.

222
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:12,100
Your mental system

223
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:13,500
must be malfunctioning again.

224
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:14,500
It's okay.

225
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:17,380
I'll get a technician

226
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,140
to fix you.

227
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:19,260
Mr. Xiao.

228
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:22,140
You claim to love
your wife and son deeply.

229
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:23,620
But based on my observations,

230
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:26,300
you've been violent toward Lu Yuchen.

231
00:11:26,900 --> 00:11:28,260
I would never

232
00:11:28,260 --> 00:11:30,580
be violent toward my son.

233
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:31,940
You're clearly

234
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:33,580
an android with violent tendencies.

235
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:35,100
Remember what you said the other day?

236
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:36,580
You know exactly
what you said, don't you?

237
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:38,580
Do I need to repeat it?

238
00:11:38,740 --> 00:11:40,740
That was because I was trying
to protect Yuchen.

239
00:11:41,180 --> 00:11:42,540
As for Ms. Lu, even while she was alive,

240
00:11:44,660 --> 00:11:46,780
you were already having an affair.

241
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,180
My turn.

242
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:09,500
Xiao Minghua.

243
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:11,100
What's going on here?

244
00:12:26,930 --> 00:12:34,030
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

245
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:39,750
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

246
00:12:39,950 --> 00:12:42,820
♪That's me, too♪

247
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:47,880
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

248
00:12:48,710 --> 00:12:51,970
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

249
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:56,420
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

250
00:12:56,910 --> 00:12:59,360
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

251
00:13:01,250 --> 00:13:03,920
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

252
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:06,170
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

253
00:13:06,170 --> 00:13:09,340
♪Bring me something more?♪

254
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:16,770
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

255
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:20,870
♪Sadness is blue♪

256
00:13:21,980 --> 00:13:25,220
♪How would you paint me?♪

257
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:29,950
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

258
00:13:29,950 --> 00:13:31,990
♪Painting without restraint♪

259
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:34,990
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

260
00:13:34,990 --> 00:13:38,940
♪If I could start over♪

261
00:13:39,350 --> 00:13:43,250
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

262
00:13:43,250 --> 00:13:45,900
♪Give me back my smile♪

263
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:48,950
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

264
00:13:49,530 --> 00:13:54,510
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
